# Legal corpus data — raw sources and the cleaned/merged + FAISS-indexed
# output are all regenerable, see data/README.md for the two commands.
# (backend/storage/faiss/*.faiss + *.json — the built index itself — is
# already covered by the bare `backend/storage/` rule below.) Do NOT ignore
# the scripts that generate these: scripts/clean_statute_corpus.py,
# ai-services/corpus_builder/build_corpus.py.
data/raw/
data/processed/

# Trained NER model (500 MB zip / 539 MB weights, over GitHub's 100 MB
